'''Teacher A''' (高校教師, ''Kōkō Kyōshi'', '''High School Teacher''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Master A.]] that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

