==Enemy==
Teacher A has lower range than [[Master A.]] (351<451) and is vulnerable to backliners. He moves faster, deals more damage, and has 20% chance to slow targets on hit.

==Strategy==
As mentioned before, Teacher A's reduced range makes him much more vulnerable to traditional backliners, which can now safely engage him without being hit. His increased damage and slow ability are generally insignificant, as he rarely appears at a sufficiently high magnification to be borderline threatening.

